     #endif

     If the process does an _e_x_e_c_v_e(2), the first 10 characters of
     the filename appear in _a_c__c_o_m_m. The accounting flag contains
     bits indicating whether _e_x_e_c_v_e(2) was ever accomplished, and
     whether the process ever had super-user privileges.

SEE ALSO
